                r o t
                  r o t
                    r o t
~~~

> The shape is the argument. Prose would need a paragraph to say what the
> missing `o` says in one column.

## the raw hatch

Below the fold is a `:::` block: raw HTML, passed through untouched. No
escaping, no parsing, no opinion. It is the freedom knob — this is your own
file on your own disk, so the markup can do anything the browser can do.

:::
